flowchart TD
S([Select Add missing ingredients]) --> G[US-15 authentication and owner gate]
G --> O{Recipe owned by account?}
O -- No --> E[403 or 404; no mutation]
O -- Yes --> I[Read owned inventory and recipe names]
I --> N[Trim and case-normalize names consistently]
N --> M[Compute unique recipe names absent from inventory]
M --> U[Atomically insert missing shopping names not already present]
U --> C[Unique owner and normalized-name key resolves repeated or concurrent adds]
C --> R([200 resulting list; existing ids stable; inventory unchanged])
